    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23914" root="صدأ" body-key="S">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدِئٌ</span></b>  [part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَدِئَ</span>, q. v.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  One says,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَدِى مِنَ الحَدِيدِ صَدِئَةٌ</span> <i>My hand is disagreeable
in smell</i> [<i>from the rust of iron</i>]. (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ صَاغِرٌ صَدِئٌ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He is one to whom disgrace,</i> or
<i>shame, and baseness,</i> or <i>meanness, attach.</i> (S, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْدَأُ</span>.

